    backlog:openedWithProfile backlog:Profile_AgenticAdaptive ;
    rdfs:comment "The Governance lineage of IPage (the framework's ruling G217: the lineage that governs the lives of lineages). Opened on the Owner's ruling IP-R1 of 2026-11-08 under the framework's default profile (agentic adaptive, revision 16, which adopts the package rules), after Lineage 3 was concluded and set down."@en .

